  "url": "https://www.urbanwatergroup.com/las-virgenestriunfo-jpa-pure-water-sustainability-garden-1",
  "title": "URBAN WATER GROUP",
  "text": "HOME\nPROJECTS\nWHO WE ARE\nNEWS & EVENTS\nMEDIA & AWARDS\nCONTACT\nURBAN WATER GROUP\nHOME\nPROJECTS\nWHO WE ARE\nNEWS & EVENTS\nMEDIA & AWARDS\nCONTACT\nLas Virgenes-Triunfo JPA Pure Water Sustainability Garden\n\nThe Pure Water Demonstration Facility is the precursor to a cutting-edge water purification plant. It will provide the means for testing different purification systems and training operators while also allowing visitors to view the process in action.\u00a0\n\nThe commitment to education led to the Pure Water Sustainability Garden, a 7,700 square foot series of garden \u201crooms\u201d surrounding the Facility.\u00a0\u00a0Each room was designed to reduce water use and/or retain storm water, featuring elements such as lawn alternatives and rain gardens, as well as an amphitheater for classes and events.\u00a0\u00a0\n\n\n\n\nFor more information visit the Pure Water Project.\u00a0\n\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nView fullsize\nPhotographs by Saxon Holt",
